 liquid ortho hydrogen at 20k computed with leapr.                   3 1451
 the scattering law is based on the model of keinert and sax,        3 1451
 which includes spin correlations from the young and koppel          3 1451
 model, diffusion and local hindered motions from an                 3 1451
 effective translational scattering law based on a frequency         3 1451
 distribution, and intermolecular coherence after vinyard.           3 1451
